{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23687","headline":"寄殷协律 · 白居易","name":"寄殷协律","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"五岁优游同过日，一朝消散[似]浮云。\n琴诗酒伴皆抛我，雪月花时最忆君。\n几度听鸡歌白日，亦曾骑马咏红裙。\n吴娘暮雨萧萧曲，自别江南更不闻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23687.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23687","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}